; What one lojix-bootstrap run remembers, and the one record it leaves
; behind. The journal is private to the run: a directory below the
; request's journal parent, named by the request's fingerprint, holding
; the journal record. Each stage is journalled as an intent before its
; effect is issued, a receipt once the effect has returned, and an outcome,
; so a resumed run reads what was done rather than doing it again. The
; record also holds what the stages produced (the resolved flake
; reference, the materialized flake inputs, the built closure and the
; GC root bound to it), the identity of the journal directory and of the
; GC root as the file system reported them, and the terminal status once
; the run has one.
;
; The terminal evidence is the record a run leaves at the caller's
; evidence path: the fingerprint that binds it to its request, the mode,
; the status, and each stage's outcome. It carries no route, path, flake
; reference or process output.
;
; A fingerprint is the lowercase hexadecimal SHA-256 of the request's
; archive. Every record is written whole, as one archive, by the
; bootstrap; nothing else reads it.
Memory

[ signal_lojix:[ ClosurePath ]
  :crate:memory:[ PersistedFlakeInputOverride ] ]

[ BootstrapJournal.{ JournalSchemaVersion RequestFingerprint BootstrapEvidenceMode
                     JournalDirectory.FileIdentity ResolvedFlakeReference Option<ClosurePath>
                     Option<GcRootReceipt> Option<MaterializedInputs>
                     Option<BootstrapEvidenceStatus> Vector<JournalEvent> }
  JournalSchemaVersion.Integer
  RequestFingerprint.String
  BootstrapEvidenceMode.[ BuildOnly BootOnce ]
  FileIdentity.{ FileDevice.Integer FileInode.Integer }
  ResolvedFlakeReference.String
  GcRootReceipt.{ ClosurePath FileIdentity }
  MaterializedInputs.Vector<PersistedFlakeInputOverride>
  BootstrapEvidenceStatus.[ Succeeded Failed ]
  JournalEvent.{ BootstrapStage JournalEventKind EventSucceeded.Boolean }
  BootstrapStage.[ JournalCreated Materialized Tested Built GcRooted Copied BootOnceScheduled
                   BootOnceActivated TerminalEvidenceWritten ]
  JournalEventKind.[ Intent Receipt Outcome ]
  BootstrapTerminalEvidence.{ JournalSchemaVersion RequestFingerprint BootstrapEvidenceMode
                              BootstrapEvidenceStatus Vector<BootstrapEffectEvidence> }
  BootstrapEffectEvidence.{ BootstrapStage EffectSucceeded.Boolean } ]
